    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your constructed body has advantages and disadvantages that most humanoid creatures do not. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against diseases, and poisons. However, you are considered to be a creature composed entirely of wood and metal for the purposes of magical or other effects - regardless of your integrated armour type.</p>"
